        "pill_note": "Verified Purchases Only",
        "left_stars": "★★★★★",
        "left_name": "Jessica V.",
        "left_verified": true,
        "left_title": "The best thing since sliced bread!!!",
        "left_body": "I suffer from horrible eczema where my skin is consistently dry and my feet are always cracked. I have tried prescription strength lotions, steroids, you name it, and everything under the sun over the counter to no avail.... Until Real Skin Care!!!! I used to have to carry 3-4 different lotions or creams around with me and apply almost hourly or anytime I washed my hands.\n\nWith Real Skin Care, I apply all over 1x in the morning and 1x before bed and my skin stays hydrated all day. My feet are no longer cracked and painful to walk on! My husband who suffers from psoriasis agrees this is the first product that keeps him hydrated and stops him from being itchy all day long. 1000\/10 recommended!",
        "top_stars": "★★★★★",
        "top_name": "Heather D.",
        "top_verified": true,
        "top_title": "Cleanest & BEST lotion & creams!",
        "top_body": "This is the cleanest & BEST lotion & creams we’ve found. It’s not greasy & really works. Esp for chronic dry skin & eczema. It’s so hard to find brands that don’t have a ton of chemicals & we’re so happy that your company exists and does such a great job! Thank you!!",
        "bottom_stars": "★★★★★",
        "bottom_name": "Nicole H.",
        "bottom_verified": true,
        "bottom_title": "Love it",
        "bottom_body": "This is the perfect moisturizer for my kids in the summer. It absorbs quickly yet is effective all day. It doesn't irritate their skin further like other lotions do. I even use on their faces. Absolutely recommend all Real Skin Care products!",
        "cta_text": "",
        "cta_url": ""
      }
