    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "question-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this lotion safe for sensitive skin?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Our formula was created specifically for ingredient-conscious customers with sensitive or reactive skin. With only 6 clean ingredients and no synthetic fragrance, parabens, or petroleum-based fillers, it’s gentle enough for daily use — even on dry, eczema-prone skin.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "36e98137-3c8d-4daa-b444-25afc6015ab2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will coconut oil clog pores or feel greasy?",
            "row_content": "<p>No. We use organic virgin coconut oil in a balanced, lightweight formula designed to absorb into the skin — not sit on top of it. Unlike heavy petroleum-based lotions, it hydrates deeply without leaving a greasy residue.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "row_content": "<p>One 8oz bottle typically lasts 30–45 days with daily full-body use. If you're applying to smaller areas (hands, arms, legs), it may last even longer. Our 2-bottle option is ideal for consistent daily use.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "011d5801-c5f6-4979-9c43-f441e593d4c0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it truly fragrance-free?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Our Pure Unscented option contains no synthetic fragrance or masking agents. Any subtle scent comes naturally from the organic ingredients themselves — nothing artificial added.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where is it made?",
            "row_content": "<p>All of our products are handmade in small batches in the USA. We prioritize quality control, clean sourcing, and ingredient transparency in every bottle we produce.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "8dde83c2-9053-43c1-acba-e91752159a59": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if it doesn’t work for me?",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you’re not completely satisfied, simply contact us and we’ll make it right — no complicated returns, no hassle.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        }
      },
